{:edb/db-before-t 2849 :edb/db-after-t 2850 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536162 50 #inst "2026-10-09T17:42:34.360Z" 13194139536162 true] [17592186129127 1020 #edb/ref 17592186386677 13194139536162 true] [17592186129127 1020 #edb/ref 17592186386684 13194139536162 true] [17592186129128 1020 #edb/ref 17592186386670 13194139536162 true] [17592186129129 1020 #edb/ref 17592186386691 13194139536162 true] [17592186129129 1020 #edb/ref 17592186386698 13194139536162 true] [17592186386670 1017 #edb/ref 17592186386671 13194139536162 true] [17592186386670 1089 "q-132287" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386670 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536162 true] [17592186386670 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/d185077fab32b6f2c85e53550da2f04f1128eb14610764ad131ed50d8bbc6ff0.png)\n\nConsider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the line $y=\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2,$ and the lines $y=-x$ and $y=x,$ as shown in the picture. Express the double integral of the function $f(x,y)$ over the region $D$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type I regions." 13194139536162 true] [17592186386670 1113 #uuid "c7ac08fc-4414-5767-ab73-e8365dc25edd" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386670 1145 "The region $D$ can be partitioned into two type I regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/47eccc29cbbdd917a247dec2f10329f718ed133b7e8398312b4ee3bc6bbbd647.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}={(x,y)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le 0,\\,-x\\le y\\le \\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 2,\\,x\\le y\\le \\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{0}{\\int }_{-x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386672 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386673 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386674 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386675 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386676 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1041 "selection" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386676 13194139536162 true] [17592186386671 1110 #uuid "9818fc63-c98c-52bf-9504-41c2b3b7f8ad" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386672 1034 "{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{\\int }_{x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}^{-x}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386672 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386672 1111 #uuid "dfa7f7dc-28e2-5fb5-9e5f-a2628896bdba" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386673 1034 "{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{\\int }_{-x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{x}^{-x}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386673 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386673 1111 #uuid "2f14721e-d941-54ff-aee4-2ebeef6f4dbf" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386674 1034 "{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{\\int }_{-x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}^{-x}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386674 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386674 1111 #uuid "732d1320-1146-5340-8053-b76b76bfefbf" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386675 1034 "{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{\\int }_{x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386675 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386675 1111 #uuid "a3f76adc-f89c-5d8b-be7a-be4d0bf1eac6" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386676 1034 "{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{\\int }_{-x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{x}^{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}+2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386676 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386676 1111 #uuid "f5acc717-e4e1-59fe-90a5-d60a45a80f34" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386677 1017 #edb/ref 17592186386678 13194139536162 true] [17592186386677 1089 "q-132490" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386677 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536162 true] [17592186386677 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/71f160891f01681b485b2eb88dccf63b05271fab8e24f069e3bab46f4168c454.png)\n\nEvaluate ${∬}_{D}6x\\,dA,$ where $D$ is the region shown in the picture above." 13194139536162 true] [17592186386677 1113 #uuid "bf731963-ce9a-5bd4-b995-3fc1a1bfea58" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386677 1145 "The region $D$ can be partitioned into two type II regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/bb95d1507eb1cd527b6d6983cc0531d71c3852db002f188f220954a367de8d95.png)\n\n  \n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 2,\\,-\\sqrt{y+2}\\le x\\le -\\sqrt{2-y}}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}={(x,y)\\,:\\,2\\le y\\le 3,\\,-\\sqrt{y+2}\\le x\\le 0}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}6x\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}6x\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}6x\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{y+2}}^{-\\sqrt{2-y}}6x\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{y+2}}^{0}6x\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}3{x}^{2}\\,{|}_{-\\sqrt{y+2}}^{-\\sqrt{2-y}}\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{3}3{x}^{2}\\,{|}_{-\\sqrt{y+2}}^{0}\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}3[{(-\\sqrt{2-y})}^{2}-{(-\\sqrt{y+2})}^{2}]\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{3}3[{0}^{2}-{(-\\sqrt{y+2})}^{2}]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}3(-2y)\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{3}3(-y-2)\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-3{\\int }_{0}^{2}2y\\,\\text{d}y-3{\\int }_{2}^{3}(y+2)\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-3{y}^{2}\\,{|}_{0}^{2}-3(\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}+2y){|}_{2}^{3} \\\\  & =-3(2)^{2}-3(\\frac{{3}^{2}}{2}+2(3))+3(\\frac{{2}^{2}}{2}+2(2)) \\\\  & =-12-\\frac{63}{2}+18 \\\\  & =-\\frac{51}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386679 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386680 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386681 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386682 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386683 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1041 "selection" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386682 13194139536162 true] [17592186386678 1110 #uuid "bec3982d-b9b6-570a-9c79-a6a64b192fa4" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386679 1034 "\\frac{27}{2}" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386679 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386679 1111 #uuid "bec31455-6f07-532c-80f3-59250512f522" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386680 1034 "22" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386680 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386680 1111 #uuid "6854dee5-75ea-5bb8-bc64-82fc4dc61925" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386681 1034 "-15" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386681 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386681 1111 #uuid "2f11e8fe-eac6-5498-a431-ac27f1eedc9b" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386682 1034 "-\\frac{51}{2}" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386682 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386682 1111 #uuid "2639738a-facf-5b29-b2f0-87991b31f0e9" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386683 1034 "-19" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386683 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386683 1111 #uuid "a28605f8-d651-5a10-8228-06c05f554e55" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386684 1017 #edb/ref 17592186386685 13194139536162 true] [17592186386684 1089 "q-37767" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386684 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536162 true] [17592186386684 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/8de0dad0436135ef40aa26666d10659f4041275a915de153b6b4b45312c1c52f.png)\n\nEvaluate ${∬}_{D}{x}^{2}y\\,dA,$ where $D$ is the region shown in the picture above." 13194139536162 true] [17592186386684 1113 #uuid "73b8a639-9b9e-566a-9004-4d47d54baa53" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386684 1145 "The region $D$ can be partitioned into three type II regions ${D}_{1},$ ${D}_{2},$ and ${D}_{3},$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/b58fc3909d5be467999053336f67d41b88b43c984208c60f3d46ee8b7479df58.png)\n\nAs a result, we get \n\n$$\n{D}_{1}={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,-2\\le x\\le -1},\n$$\n\n$$\n{D}_{2}={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,1\\le x\\le 2}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{3}={(x,y)\\,:\\,1\\le y\\le 3,\\,-2\\le x\\le 2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}{x}^{2}y\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}{x}^{2}y\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}{x}^{2}y\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{3}}{x}^{2}y\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-2}^{-1}{x}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{3}{\\int }_{-2}^{2}{x}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{y\\text{ }\\,{x}^{3}}{3}]}_{-2}^{-1}\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{y\\text{ }\\,{x}^{3}}{3}]}_{1}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{3}{[\\frac{y\\text{ }\\,{x}^{3}}{3}]}_{-2}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{7y}{3}\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{7y}{3}\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{16y}{3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{7}{3}\\cdot {[\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{16}{3}\\cdot {[\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}]}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{3}+\\frac{64}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{71}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386686 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386687 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386688 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386689 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386690 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1041 "selection" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386688 13194139536162 true] [17592186386685 1110 #uuid "81a45d34-76aa-51cc-97e6-353a0d85646b" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386686 1034 "\\frac{51}{4}" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386686 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386686 1111 #uuid "e66bfcb4-eb74-5123-a59f-8b32dc92f0d1" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386687 1034 "-\\frac{81}{6}" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386687 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386687 1111 #uuid "53557652-9646-5ce6-8050-520be27febc4" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386688 1034 "\\frac{71}{3}" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386688 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386688 1111 #uuid "527810e2-0571-52b6-8be0-ad9e56e651b2" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386689 1034 "\\frac{41}{6}" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386689 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386689 1111 #uuid "a4305c55-8a51-501c-a1b0-26a6c21f82d2" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386690 1034 "\\frac{61}{5}" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386690 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386690 1111 #uuid "cf0d7b33-110c-5a1c-94de-b1c83beecab6" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386691 1017 #edb/ref 17592186386692 13194139536162 true] [17592186386691 1089 "q-82135" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386691 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536162 true] [17592186386691 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/4174f3930bb19223300539e1b4e9b7b191669aa4f701bff51e8349d0710ce6fb.png)\n\nConsider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the curves $y={e}^{x},$ $y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x,$ and the lines $y=1+e-x$  and $y=1-x,$ as shown in the picture. Express the double integral of the function $f(x,y)$ over the region $D$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type II regions." 13194139536162 true] [17592186386691 1113 #uuid "69d17ba3-e63c-55a0-998e-c9f66d44a218" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386691 1145 "First, let's write our equations in terms of $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y={e}^{x} & \\,⟹\\,x=\\operatorname{ln}⁡y \\\\ y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x & \\,⟹\\,x={e}^{y} \\\\ y=1+e-x & \\,⟹\\,x=1+e-y \\\\ y=1-x & \\,⟹\\,x=1-y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe region $D$ can be partitioned into two type II regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/4df7cf2f33520a80270341d4a40b4a83d9f3c11ed8adb69fe1131a42bcd61d5a.png)\n\n    \n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,1-y\\le x\\le {e}^{y}}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}={(x,y)\\,:\\,1\\le y\\le e,\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡y\\le x\\le 1+e-y}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{1-y}^{{e}^{y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{e}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}^{1+e-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386693 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386694 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386695 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386696 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386697 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1041 "selection" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386694 13194139536162 true] [17592186386692 1110 #uuid "d25c6a8c-cd12-5f63-be95-c598f3b6d044" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386693 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{1-y}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{e}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}^{1+e-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386693 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386693 1111 #uuid "7b582f21-e539-588c-9c49-50df1d5d8e99" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386694 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{1-y}^{{e}^{y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{e}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}^{1+e-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386694 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386694 1111 #uuid "e0bdee49-1216-598a-b6ab-37913d78e2a4" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386695 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{1-y}^{{e}^{y}}f(x,y)\\,dx\\,dy+{\\int }_{2}^{e}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}^{e-y}f(x,y)\\,dx\\,dy" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386695 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386695 1111 #uuid "9299300d-5181-5a13-b3d2-1aaba51803c2" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386696 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-y}^{{e}^{2}y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2e}{\\int }_{-\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}^{1+e-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386696 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386696 1111 #uuid "eca2eac0-f022-5442-97ff-b83dc545b652" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386697 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{\\int }_{1-y+e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1/2}^{e}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡y}^{1-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386697 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386697 1111 #uuid "4258545b-f7ea-581c-945c-df1ad9904d4d" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386698 1017 #edb/ref 17592186386699 13194139536162 true] [17592186386698 1089 "q-82358" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386698 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536162 true] [17592186386698 1100 "Consider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the curve $y=\\sqrt{x-2}+1,$ and the lines $y=2-\\frac{1}{2}x$ and $y=8-2x.$ Express ${∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type II regions." 13194139536162 true] [17592186386698 1113 #uuid "9fc12f5e-e89a-5d92-929e-151cd796ef36" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386698 1145 "First, let's write our equations in terms of $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=\\sqrt{x-2}+1 & \\,⟹\\,x=(y-1)^{2}+2 \\\\ y=2-\\frac{1}{2}x & \\,⟹\\,x=4-2y \\\\ y=8-2x & \\,⟹\\,x=4-\\frac{1}{2}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's sketch our region.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/3f8e3ccfeac236d7fe9a502f599c61c404607a55ae809ec142019a3f881e1568.png)\n\n  \n\nThe region $D$ can be partitioned into two type II regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14082081/assets/3148cb0f499564db9cbfd6b635fef81dc47298789241af4a243c32dbf4dc8247.png)\n\n  \n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,4-2y\\le x\\le 4-\\frac{1}{2}y}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}={(x,y)\\,:\\,1\\le y\\le 2,\\,(y-1)^{2}+2\\le x\\le 4-\\frac{1}{2}y}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{4-2y}^{4-y/2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{(y-1)^{2}+2}^{4-y/2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386700 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386701 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386702 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386703 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386704 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1041 "selection" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386703 13194139536162 true] [17592186386699 1110 #uuid "07cec407-ae44-5aa8-99a5-ac43a1b8cf06" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386700 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{4-2y}^{4-y/2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{4-2y}^{4-y/2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386700 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386700 1111 #uuid "005b94db-ac29-5528-ab33-f2928b186525" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386701 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{4-y/2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{(y-1)^{2}+2}^{4-y/2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386701 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386701 1111 #uuid "a86dbd66-00b4-51f3-946d-d530eb2e3f97" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386702 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{4-2y}^{4-y/2}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{(y-1)^{2}+2}^{4-2y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386702 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536162 true] [17592186386702 1111 #uuid "c68e5ce5-14f9-5026-8f64-0614515bb822" 13194139536162 true] [17592186386703 1034 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{4-2y}^{4-y/2}f(x,